<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CSS3 Animation 통합 학습 문서 - 예제 7-11, 7-12</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Malgun Gothic", "Noto Sans KR", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #202938;
    background: #f4f7fb;
  }
  .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px; }
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #173b78, #315fa8);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 30px 34px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  }
  header h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 2rem; }
  header p { margin: 0; opacity: .92; }
  .top-image {
    margin: 24px 0 32px;
    background: white;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .top-image img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: block;
    margin: auto;
  }
  .section {
    background: white;
    margin: 28px 0;
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.07);
  }
  h2 {
    color: #173b78;
    border-left: 6px solid #315fa8;
    padding-left: 12px;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  h3 { color: #274c80; margin-top: 26px; }
  .summary-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .card {
    background: #f7faff;
    border: 1px solid #d8e4f5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .card strong { color: #173b78; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 14px 0;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #d6dfeb;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th { background: #eaf1fb; color: #173b78; }
  pre {
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: #182230;
    color: #e7edf7;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: .9rem;
  }
  code { font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace; }
  .note {
    background: #fff8df;
    border-left: 5px solid #e0a400;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
